  "body_text": null,
  "page": null,
  "source": "[\\(antisymmetric)::relation:?on{X}]\nRefines: R\nwhen: X is \\set\nsatisfies:\n. forAll: x, y \"in\" X\n  where:\n  . R(x, y)\n  . R(y, x)\n  then: x = y\nDocumented:\n. adjective: \"antisymmetric\"\n. description: \"A relation $R$ on $X$ is antisymmetric if $x \\mathrel{R} y$ and\n                $y \\mathrel{R} x$ imply $x = y$.\"\nId: \"8ed4e2b2-f1b7-4131-8ae2-2834e71805fa\"",
